Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 22:58:54 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] nx-0971: Switch buttons (vol GPIO X6/X7, power via MAX77620
 ONOFFSTAT, vol+ and vol- = Home); Tegra I2C helper; touch geometry for the
 720x1280 panel

---
